            {
              "id": "q-4",
              "displayNumber": 4,
              "sourceQuestionNumber": 4,
              "type": "oral_response",
              "promptBlocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Part B Role Play (角色扮演)"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "视频原文"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "M: Hi, Mary. I went to your dorm last night, but didn’t find you. Where were you?"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "W: Oh, I was at the Student Union last night till 10:30 pm."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "M: Why so late?"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "W: I was in a meeting and it lasted for three hours. I was so tired."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "M: Three hours? It was quite long. What was this meeting about?"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "W: It was about a reading project we’re going to carry out on campus. The head teacher was also at the meeting to support us."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "M: Sounds interesting. Will all the students participate in the reading project?"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "W: Not really. We will give it a try on all the Grade 11 students in this term."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "三问"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "提问①：你们将如何组织这个阅读活动？"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "翻译：How will you organize the reading activity?"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "电脑回答：Well, we’re going to put the students in different reading groups. We will give them a theme each week with a reading list. Each group will produce a reading report every two weeks. We may also organize other activities, for example, storytelling competition and drama show."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "提问②：有些什么主题呢？"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "翻译：What themes are there?"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "电脑回答：We have chosen ten themes covering Chinese history, space travel, legends, music, adventures, etc. There are 18 weeks this term, so we need more themes. The Student Union has designed a poster calling for all the students to come up with themes for the remaining weeks."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "提问③：学生们可以在哪里找到书单上的书？"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "翻译：Where can students find the books on the reading?"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "电脑回答：They can find most of the books on the list in the school library. We have spent quite a lot of time in sorting out the books in the library according to different reading themes. We will also provide them with some electronic books. The students can download them from either the school website or the city library website."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "五答"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "1. 电脑提问：How long did Mary’s meeting last?"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "考生回答：Three hours."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "2. 电脑提问：Who will participate in the reading project for this term?"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "考生回答：All the Grade 11 students."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "3. 电脑提问：How often should each group write a reading report?  "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "考生回答：Every two weeks."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "4. 电脑提问：Why did the Student Union design a poster?"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "考生回答：To call for all the students to come up with the themes for the remaining week."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "5. 电脑提问：Where can the students download the electronic books from?"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "考生回答：From either the school website or the city library website."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
